  speaker: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 220c64b1d598ddf41bc3f43bc6849160, type: 2}
  descriptionLocalized:
    english: "Chancellor: 'Wisely done, Sire. The cinders are scattered to the winds. The sovereign right to rule must never be divided, lest the kingdom tear itself apart.'"
    arabic: "المستشار: «فعلت عين الصواب يا مولاي! تذرو الرياح رمادها، فحكم المملكة لا يحتمل شريكين، وإلا تمزق التاج إرباً.»"
  dayAdvance: 1
  leftChoiceLocalized:
    english: "Keep the Jester closely watched under guard."
    arabic: "ضع البهلوان تحت مراقبة أمنية مشددة."
  leftResourceChange:
    values:
    - resource: {fileID: 11400000, guid: b891174f857049f44be00b474746951e, type: 2}
